---
import ScaleIcon from '@/assets/icons/scale.svg';
import LightbulbIcon from '@/assets/icons/lightbulb.svg';
---

<section class="w-full bg-surface md:bg-surface-container-high py-4 md:py-space-xl px-margin-mobile md:px-margin">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
    <!-- Mobile Rich Mocha Card / Desktop Soft Latte Container -->
    <div
      class="bg-primary text-on-primary md:bg-surface-container md:text-on-surface md:border md:border-craft-border rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-space-xl shadow-ambient relative overflow-hidden"
    >
      <!-- Subtle Mobile Scale Watermark -->
      <div
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="md:hidden absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 opacity-12 pointer-events-none text-on-primary"
      >
        <ScaleIcon class="w-28 h-28" aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>

      <!-- Mobile Layout -->
      <div class="flex md:hidden flex-col gap-2.5 relative z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <LightbulbIcon class="w-5 h-5 text-secondary-fixed shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
          <span class="text-label-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-secondary-fixed">
            Dato Nutricional Clave
          </span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-title-md text-surface-bright leading-snug">
          ¿Sabías que <span class="text-secondary-fixed font-bold">1 patita deshidratada</span>{' '}
          equivale a <span class="text-secondary-fixed font-bold">25 gramos de croquetas</span> en
          aporte proteico y colágeno bioasimilable?
        </h2>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1 gap-2 flex-wrap">
          <span class="text-label-sm font-medium text-on-primary-container">
            Menos procesado, mayor absorción.
          </span>
          <span
            class="text-label-sm bg-primary-container px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-surface-bright"
          >
            Digestible 98% • ~65 kcal
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Desktop 12-Col Equivalence Banner -->
      <div class="hidden md:grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex items-center gap-space-md">
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-mocha text-eggshell flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-xs"
          >
            <ScaleIcon class="w-8 h-8" aria-hidden="true" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest">
              Equivalencia Nutritiva
            </span>
            <h2 class="font-display text-headline-md text-primary leading-tight">
              1 Patita = 25g de croquetas premium
            </h2>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            La masticación prolongada de cartílago natural produce enzimas salivales que limpian
            placa bacteriana mientras el colágeno hidrata los discos intervertebrales y ligamentos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-3 flex lg:justify-end">
          <div
            class="bg-eggshell border border-craft-border px-space-lg py-space-md rounded-xl shadow-xs text-center w-full lg:w-auto"
          >
            <span class="text-label-sm font-medium text-on-surface-variant block">
              Calorías promedio por unidad
            </span>
            <span class="font-display text-headline-lg text-secondary block">~65 kcal</span>
            <span class="text-label-sm text-mocha block">Sin harinas ni carbohidratos</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
